    <string name="about_dialog_title">About Structural Analysis FEA Advanced</string>
    <string name="about_dialog_message">Structural Analysis FEA Advanced v0.1.0\n\nHigh-performance 3D Solid &amp; Frame Finite Element Analysis (FEA) platform for Android.\nPowered by CalculiX (CCX 2.23), Gmsh 3D mesh generator (v5.0.0), and OpenCASCADE Technology (OCCT 8.0.0.p1).\n\nLead Developer: Daniel Diamon\nLocation: Tinaquillo, Cojedes, Venezuela\nLicense: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPLv3)\nRepository: https://github.com/Danielk10/Calculo_Estructural</string>
    <string name="licenses_dialog_title">About &amp; Licenses</string>
    <string name="licenses_dialog_message">Structural Analysis FEA Advanced v0.1.0\n\nHigh-performance 3D Solid &amp; Frame Finite Element Analysis (FEA) platform for Android.\nPowered by CalculiX (CCX 2.23), Gmsh 3D mesh generator (v5.0.0), and OpenCASCADE Technology (OCCT 8.0.0.p1).\n\nLead Developer: Daniel Diamon\nLocation: Tinaquillo, Cojedes, Venezuela\nLicense: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPLv3)\n\nBundled Open-Source Scientific Components &amp; Repositories:\n• CalculiX (CCX 2.23): GNU GPL (Guido Dhondt)\n  https://www.calculix.de\n• Gmsh (v5.0.0): GNU GPL v2.0+ (C. Geuzaine, J.-F. Remacle)\n  https://gmsh.info\n• OpenCASCADE Technology (OCCT 8.0.0.p1): GNU LGPL v2.1\n  https://dev.opencascade.org\n  https://github.com/Open-CASCADE-Technology/OCCT\n• SPOOLES (v2.2 MT): Public Domain (C. Ashcraft, J. Liu)\n  https://www.netlib.org/linalg/spooles/spooles.2.2.html\n• ARPACK-NG: BSD 3-Clause\n  https://github.com/opencollab/arpack-ng\n• OpenBLAS / LAPACK: BSD 3-Clause\n  https://github.com/OpenMathLib/OpenBLAS\n  https://www.netlib.org/lapack/\n• SceneView / Filament: Apache License 2.0\n  https://github.com/SceneView/sceneview-android\n  https://github.com/google/filament\n• iText 7 Core (v7.2.5): AGPL v3.0\n  https://github.com/itext/itext7\n• GCC Fortran Runtime: GNU GPL v3.0+\n  https://gcc.gnu.org</string>

